{"id":"dmwbbm6phfo03","name":"下拉刷新","tags":["加载","拖拽","动画"],"aliases":[],"summary":"手机列表顶部下拉时内容直接跟手位移，越拉越涩；顶部露出指示器，箭头随进度旋转，不足阈值显示「继续下拉」、越过变成「松手刷新」；松手后停在保持位转圈，刷新完回弹归位并显示「已更新」。","usage":"移动端或窄屏列表页的首屏刷新，刷新是一次能拿到完成事件的完整请求。","caution":"桌面端用按钮刷新更合适；刷新可能失败时要补失败态，别只做成功分支。页面本身可滚动时别和滚动边界重复接管。","hint":"在列表上按住向下拖，越过一半松手开始刷新。","inspiration":"","prompt":"【下拉刷新】目标：列表顶部下拉时内容直接跟手位移并带边界阻尼，顶部露出指示器；松手过阈值进入刷新，刷新完回弹归位。\n\n1) 结构：phone（圆角 16px、高 152px、overflow:hidden）> bar（22px，标题 + 右侧小「刷新」按钮）+ pane（overflow:hidden、touch-action:pan-y、user-select:none）> track > ind（固定高 54px、纵向排列：16px 箭头 SVG + 文字 9.5px）+ list（3 行 32px）。track 初始 transform: translateY(-54px)，让 ind 完全藏在 pane 上方。\n\n2) 跟手阻尼：dy = damp(raw)：raw ≤ 0 用 raw*0.18；0 < raw ≤ 54 一比一；raw > 54 用 54 + 26*(1-exp(-(raw-54)/24))，上限约 80。这样前 54px 完全跟手、之后越来越涩，但不会无限拉长。pointermove 里每帧直接写 track.style.transform = translateY(-54+dy)，同时用 dy/54 算进度旋转箭头 rotate(0→180deg)，绝不写 transition。\n\n3) 指示器状态：dy < 52 时文字「继续下拉」、箭头朝下；dy ≥ 52 加 .ready，文字「松手刷新」、箭头转到 180° 朝上（用进度直接算角度，不要离散跳变）。保持位 54px，箭头与文字靠底部（justify-content:flex-end + padding-bottom 5px），这样下拉 10px 左右就能看到文字。\n\n4) 松手与刷新：dy ≥ 54 或 (vx > 0.55px/ms 且 dy > 24) 进入 refresh；否则 settleTo(0, 300ms, cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.24,1))。refresh 流程：先 settleTo(54, 230ms) 到保持位 → 切 .loading（转圈 0.7 秒 linear + 「正在刷新…」）→ 等 1.05 秒 → 切 .done（直线 SVG 对勾 + 「已更新」）→ settleTo(0, 340ms) → 0.52 秒后回到 idle 文案。refresh 期间忽略新的 pointerdown。\n\n5) 取消/反向/快速重复：向上拉超过 0 也走阻尼（raw*0.18），避免露底；pointercancel 回 0（280ms）；拖动中途反向，dy 直接减小，箭头和文字立刻跟着回退。settleTo 前先 cancel 旧动画，pointerdown 时同样先量当前 dy 再 cancel 再写回，保证从可见位置接管、不跳。快速重复松手时 refresh 用 mode 挡掉重入。\n\n6) 非拖动入口：bar 右侧「刷新」按钮走同一个 refresh()，键盘可用；role=status 播报「正在刷新 / 刷新完成」，但不要每帧播报。\n\n7) 无障碍与降级：prefers-reduced-motion 下 settleTo 直接设值、转圈换成静态文字；不要把刷新完成当作必然成功——真实场景刷新可能失败，要留失败态入口。\n\n8) 配色：只用 --ui-*。手机壳用 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface))，边框 color-mix(text 15%)，行底色 color-mix(text 4%)，主色用 --ui-brand。\n\n9) 坑：ind 高度必须等于 GAP(54)，否则初始会露 2px 残影；track 内容总高要能被 pane 裁掉，别让 pane 撑高；setDy 里只有在 idle 状态才改文案，刷新/完成态不要被拖动覆盖；演示光标的位移过渡要禁用（加 .sweeping）。\n\n10) 自动演示：包在 !window.__uiInteractive 里。cursor.at 到 pane 上部 → 0.54 秒后 press → 每帧 tween 到 raw 128 并 cursor.at 同步下移 → release → 走 refresh() → 约 3 秒后循环。","demoHtml":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>下拉刷新</title>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{height:100%}\n  body{margin:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px;\n    background:var(--ui-bg);color:var(--ui-text);overflow:hidden;\n    font:13px/1.35 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}\n  .phone{width:100%;max-width:236px;height:100%;max-height:152px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;\n    border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;\n    background:var(--ui-surface);\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));\n    border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n    border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 15%,transparent);\n    box-shadow:0 7px 22px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 13%,transparent)}\n  .bar{flex:0 0 auto;height:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n    padding:0 8px 0 10px;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n    border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 8%,transparent)}\n  .bar b{font-weight:600;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--ui-text)}\n  .ref{flex:0 0 auto;margin:0;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid transparent;\n    background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:9px;line-height:1.3;cursor:pointer;\n    transition:background .16s ease,color .16s ease}\n  .ref:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 9%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text)}\n  .ref:active{transform:scale(.94)}\n  .ref:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ui-brand);outline-offset:1px}\n  .pane{position:relative;flex:1 1 auto;overflow:hidden;touch-action:pan-y;\n    -webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}\n  .track{will-change:transform}\n  .ind{height:54px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;\n    gap:3px;padding:0 0 5px}\n  .arrow{width:15px;height:15px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);transform:rotate(0deg)}\n  .arrow svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;\n    stroke-width:2.1;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n  .ind .txt{font-size:9.5px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .ind.ready .arrow,.ind.ready .txt{color:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .spin{display:none;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;\n    border:2px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 20%,transparent);\n    border-top-color:var(--ui-brand);animation:spin .7s linear infinite}\n  .ind.loading .arrow{display:none}\n  .ind.loading .spin{display:block}\n  .ind.loading .txt,.ind.done .txt{color:var(--ui-brand)}\n  .tick{display:none;width:14px;height:14px;color:var(--ui-success)}\n  .tick svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;\n    stroke-width:2.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n  .ind.done .arrow{display:none}\n  .ind.done .tick{display:block}\n  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}\n  .list{padding:0 8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}\n  .item{height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:9px;\n    background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 4%,var(--ui-surface));\n    border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 9%,transparent)}\n  .dot{flex:0 0 auto;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ui-brand);opacity:.7}\n  .item b{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;\n    white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n  .item i{flex:0 0 auto;font-style:normal;font-size:8.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n  .sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n  .demo-cursor.sweeping{transition:none}\n  @media (max-height:420px){\n    body{padding:9px}\n    .phone{max-height:158px}\n    .bar{height:20px}\n    .ind{height:54px}\n    .item{height:30px}\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"phone\">\n  <div class=\"bar\">\n    <b>今天</b>\n    <button class=\"ref\" type=\"button\" id=\"ref\" aria-label=\"刷新列表\">刷新</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pane\" id=\"pane\">\n    <div class=\"track\" id=\"track\">\n      <div class=\"ind\" id=\"ind\">\n        <div class=\"arrow\" id=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 4.5v13\"/><path d=\"M6.5 12.5 12 18l5.5-5.5\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"spin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <div class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"txt\" id=\"txt\">继续下拉</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"list\">\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><b>周报已自动归档</b><i>09:12</i></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><b>有 2 条待确认的邀请</b><i>08:40</i></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><b>存储空间已用 62%</b><i>昨天</i></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sr\" id=\"live\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  \"use strict\";\n  var HOLD = 54;           /* 阈值：松手时超过它就刷新 */\n  var GAP = 54;            /* 指示器区域高度，也就是保持位 */\n  var track = document.getElementById(\"track\");\n  var pane = document.getElementById(\"pane\");\n  var ind = document.getElementById(\"ind\");\n  var arrow = document.getElementById(\"arrow\");\n  var txt = document.getElementById(\"txt\");\n  var live = document.getElementById(\"live\");\n  var ref = document.getElementById(\"ref\");\n\n  var state = {mode: \"idle\", dy: 0, anim: null, drag: false, base: 0, pid: null, vx: 0, lastY: 0, lastT: 0, timer: null};\n  var reduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\n  var cursor = null, demoTimer = null;\n\n  track.style.transform = \"translateY(\" + (-GAP) + \"px)\";\n\n  /* 边界阻尼：0–GAP 之间一比一跟手，过了就越来越涩，最多到 80 */\n  function damp(raw){\n    if (raw <= 0) return raw * 0.18;\n    if (raw <= GAP) return raw;\n    return GAP + 26 * (1 - Math.exp(-(raw - GAP) / 24));\n  }\n  function currentDy(){\n    var t = getComputedStyle(track).transform;\n    if (!t || t === \"none\") return 0;\n    var m = t.match(/matrix\\(([^)]+)\\)/);\n    if (!m) return 0;\n    var y = parseFloat(m[1].split(\",\")[5]);\n    return isNaN(y) ? 0 : y + GAP;\n  }\n  function setDy(dy){\n    state.dy = dy;\n    track.style.transform = \"translateY(\" + (-GAP + dy).toFixed(2) + \"px)\";\n    var p = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, dy / GAP));\n    arrow.style.transform = \"rotate(\" + (p * 180).toFixed(1) + \"deg)\";\n    if (state.mode === \"idle\"){\n      if (dy >= HOLD - 2){ ind.classList.add(\"ready\"); txt.textContent = \"松手刷新\"; }\n      else { ind.classList.remove(\"ready\"); txt.textContent = \"继续下拉\"; }\n      ind.classList.remove(\"loading\", \"done\");\n    }\n  }\n  function settleTo(to, dur, done){\n    var from = currentDy();\n    if (state.anim){ try{ state.anim.cancel(); }catch(e){} state.anim = null; }\n    if (reduced || Math.abs(to - from) < 0.6){\n      setDy(to);\n      if (done) done();\n      return;\n    }\n    var a = track.animate([\n      {transform:\"translateY(\" + (-GAP + from) + \"px)\"},\n      {transform:\"translateY(\" + (-GAP + to) + \"px)\"}\n    ], {duration: dur, easing: \"cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.24,1)\", fill: \"both\"});\n    state.anim = a;\n    a.onfinish = function(){\n      setDy(to);\n      try{ a.cancel(); }catch(e){}\n      if (state.anim === a) state.anim = null;\n      if (done) done();\n    };\n  }\n  function refresh(){\n    if (state.mode !== \"idle\") return;\n    state.mode = \"loading\";\n    ind.classList.remove(\"ready\", \"done\");\n    ind.classList.add(\"loading\");\n    txt.textContent = \"正在刷新…\";\n    live.textContent = \"正在刷新\";\n    settleTo(GAP, 230, function(){\n      state.timer = setTimeout(function(){\n        if (state.mode !== \"loading\") return;\n        state.mode = \"done\";\n        ind.classList.remove(\"loading\");\n        ind.classList.add(\"done\");\n        ind.classList.remove(\"ready\");\n        txt.textContent = \"已更新\";\n        live.textContent = \"刷新完成\";\n        settleTo(0, 340, function(){\n          state.timer = setTimeout(function(){\n            state.mode = \"idle\";\n            ind.classList.remove(\"done\", \"loading\", \"ready\");\n            txt.textContent = \"继续下拉\";\n          }, 520);\n        });\n      }, 1050);\n    });\n  }\n\n  pane.addEventListener(\"pointerdown\", function(e){\n    if (e.pointerType === \"mouse\" && e.button !== 0) return;\n    if (e.target.closest && e.target.closest(\"button\")) return;\n    if (state.mode !== \"idle\") return;\n    /* 中断接管：先量当前实际位移，再停掉旧动画 */\n    var mid = currentDy();\n    if (state.anim){ try{ state.anim.cancel(); }catch(e2){} state.anim = null; }\n    setDy(mid);\n    state.drag = true; state.pid = e.pointerId;\n    state.base = e.clientY - mid;\n    state.lastY = e.clientY; state.lastT = performance.now(); state.vx = 0;\n    try{ pane.setPointerCapture(state.pid); }catch(e2){}\n  });\n  pane.addEventListener(\"pointermove\", function(e){\n    if (!state.drag) return;\n    e.preventDefault();\n    var now = performance.now(), dt = now - state.lastT;\n    if (dt > 0){\n      state.vx = state.vx * 0.6 + ((e.clientY - state.lastY) / dt) * 0.4;\n      state.lastY = e.clientY; state.lastT = now;\n    }\n    /* 跟手：指针到哪内容就位移到哪，不用缓动追赶 */\n    setDy(damp(e.clientY - state.base));\n  });\n  function end(){\n    if (!state.drag) return;\n    state.drag = false;\n    if (state.pid !== null){ try{ pane.releasePointerCapture(state.pid); }catch(e){} state.pid = null; }\n    var dy = currentDy();\n    if (dy >= HOLD || (state.vx > 0.55 && dy > 24)) refresh();\n    else settleTo(0, 300, function(){\n      ind.classList.remove(\"ready\");\n      txt.textContent = \"继续下拉\";\n      arrow.style.transform = \"rotate(0deg)\";\n    });\n    state.vx = 0;\n  }\n  pane.addEventListener(\"pointerup\", end);\n  pane.addEventListener(\"pointercancel\", function(){\n    if (!state.drag) return;\n    state.drag = false;\n    if (state.pid !== null){ try{ pane.releasePointerCapture(state.pid); }catch(e){} state.pid = null; }\n    settleTo(0, 280);\n  });\n  ref.addEventListener(\"click\", function(){ if (state.mode === \"idle\") refresh(); });\n\n  function tween(dur, from, to, onStep, done){\n    if (reduced){ onStep(to); if (done) done(); return; }\n    var t0 = performance.now();\n    function frame(t){\n      var p = Math.min(1, (t - t0) / dur);\n      var e = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 2.3);\n      onStep(from + (to - from) * e);\n      if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n      else if (done) done();\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n  }\n\n  function startDemo(){\n    if (state.mode !== \"idle\"){\n      demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 500);\n      return;\n    }\n    if (typeof window.__uiDemoCursor !== \"function\") return;\n    var r = pane.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if (!r.width || !r.height){ demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 400); return; }\n    if (!cursor) cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    if (!cursor || !cursor.el) return;\n    var x = r.left + r.width * 0.55;\n    var y0 = r.top + 26;\n    cursor.el.classList.add(\"show\");\n    cursor.at(x, y0);\n    demoTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      cursor.el.classList.add(\"sweeping\");\n      tween(640, 0, 128, function(raw){\n        setDy(damp(raw));\n        cursor.at(x, y0 + raw);\n      }, function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        cursor.el.classList.remove(\"sweeping\");\n        var dy = currentDy();\n        if (dy >= HOLD) refresh();\n        else settleTo(0, 300);\n        demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 3050);\n      });\n    }, 540);\n  }\n\n  if (!window.__uiInteractive){\n    demoTimer = setTimeout(startDemo, 340);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","createdAt":1794353283701,"updatedAt":"2026-11-10T23:28:22.066Z"}